---


  <div class="passphrase-band" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <main class="relative z-10 pt-24 pb-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <section class="passphrase-stage">
        <div class="passphrase-copy">
          <img src="/excited.png" alt="Miso aufgeregt" class="w-20 h-20 mb-5 mascot-glow" />
          <p class="passphrase-kicker">Lesbare lange Geheimnisse</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black mb-4 text-[#4A3728] dark:text-[#F0E6D8]">Reisepass</h1>
          <p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-base leading-relaxed max-w-md">lange, unterfriktionsgeheimnisse für Orte, an denen Länge willkommen ist und die Erinnerungswürdigkeit wichtiger ist als die Einhaltung von Fussy Symbolregeln.</p>
          <div class="passphrase-example" aria-hidden="true">bloom-tiger-leaf-fog</div>
        </div>

        <div class="passphrase-tool" aria-labelledby="passphraseToolTitle">
          <div class="passphrase-tool-head">
            <div>
              <p class="passphrase-kicker">Generator</p>
              <h2 id="passphraseToolTitle" class="text-xl font-black text-[#4A3728] dark:text-[#F0E6D8]">Frische Passphrasen</h2>
            </div>
            <span class="passphrase-badge" id="passphraseCountBadge">4 Wörter</span>
          </div>

          <button type="button" id="passphrasePanel" class="passphrase-panel">
            <output id="passphraseDisplay" class="passphrase-display" aria-live="polite">Generieren...</output>
            <span id="passphraseHint" class="passphrase-hint">Klicken Sie auf Passphrase</span>
          </button>

          <div class="passphrase-actions">
            <button type="button" id="passphraseGenerate" class="cta-btn passphrase-generate">Neue Passphrase generieren</button>
            <button type="button" id="passphraseCopy" class="passphrase-copy-btn">
              <span class="ui-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
              </span>
              Kopie
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="passphrase-controls" aria-label="Passphrasen Optionen">
            <div>
              <div class="control-label">Wörter</div>
              <div class="segmented-control" data-control="count">
                <button type="button" data-count="4" aria-pressed="true">4</button>
                <button type="button" data-count="5" aria-pressed="false">5</button>
                <button type="button" data-count="6" aria-pressed="false">6</button>
                <button type="button" data-count="8" aria-pressed="false">8</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="control-label">Separator</div>
              <div class="segmented-control" data-control="separator">
                <button type="button" data-separator="-" aria-pressed="true">-</button>
                <button type="button" data-separator=" " aria-pressed="false">Raum</button>
                <button type="button" data-separator="." aria-pressed="false">.</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="control-label">Rechtssache</div>
              <div class="segmented-control" data-control="case">
                <button type="button" data-case="lower" aria-pressed="true">tiefer</button>
                <button type="button" data-case="title" aria-pressed="false">Titel</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="passphrase-notes" aria-label="Passphrasenführung">
        <div class="note-strip note-strip-green">
          <div class="note-icon ui-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2>Verwenden Sie Passphrasen, wenn die Länge erlaubt ist.</h2>
            <p>Sie glänzen für Tresor-Master-Passwörter, Wi-Fi-Passwörter, Geräte-Passcodes, Recovery-Phrasen, die Sie brauchen, um von Hand eingeben, und jeden Ort, der Leerzeichen oder Separatoren akzeptiert.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="note-strip note-strip-yellow">
          <div class="note-icon ui-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3.2 8.4-7 10-3.8-1.6-7-5-7-10V6l7-3z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2>Verwenden Sie Firm oder Extra Firm für Picky Formulare.</h2>
            <p>Wenn eine Website Kapitals, ein Symbol und Zahlen verlangt, hält der Hauptgenerator diese Anforderungen in jedes Soft, Firm und Extra Firm Passwort gebaut.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
